{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "05d3be97-1b30-5c13-8330-1c5bb3992838", "source_ordinal": 711, "reading_ordinal": 3346, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "两个钱包", "published_at": "2025-06-26T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/b1a6164a4c7211f0bedc52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我们不妨粗俗一点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就想象你是一个简单粗暴的傻鸟，每句都不是人话，但你金钱无限，对方刚一不爽，你立马转账1314.20元。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "于是你构建了一种纯“挨骂换金钱”的人际关系。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你对这个关系社不“社恐”？", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "金钱无限，那还有啥好说的，对吧？", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "挨骂领钱的一方呢？虽然不能说人人都乐意，但肯定也不少。所以人家也没问题，对吧？", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题是不是解决了？", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "唯一问题——你没有无限金钱。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但无论如何，这个极端案例我们是立住了，“无限金钱 + 0社交能力”是一个可行的方案，对吧？", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那么“大量金钱 + 0.1社交能力”呢？", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "也就是你每两句就有一句人话，那么你的句均打款是不是就降到了657.10元了？", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "看见没，一句人话换657.1块钱。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 304}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那要是“0.2社交能力”呢？", "char_start": 305, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你看明白了吧？", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "社交能力越强，钞能力要求越低。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "现在我们再引入劳动问题——钱当然都是劳动来的。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "也就是说这个公式是：劳动获利 - 劳动过程中社交损耗 = 劳动纯利。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "劳动越有效，社会对你的社交能力要求就越低，因为你有来自劳动成果的收益可以去“买下”人们因你社交能力欠缺导致的不愉快，从而可以让整个体系运转起来。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "现在关键来了，这个你要听好——有没有听过“1 + 1 > 2”？", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "一个人加另一个人，分工合作可以产生超过一个人孤军奋战的超额收益，这个熟悉吧？", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 547}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "也就是说——原本没有你，ta每小时就得到20块；现在有了你，你们合作可以一起赚到50块，对半分之后ta可以得到25块，你也可以得到25块。", "char_start": 548, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "ta多得到5块钱，这5块钱是因你而来，但却并不是你给的，看到没有？", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而你自己呢？", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "原本单干20块，现在也是多得了5块。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 677}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "现在我们假设你的社交能力很差，那么你其实现在就有这多的5块钱可以打给对方，让对方看在钱的面子上消消气。", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 729}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "但你转换到对方的视角看，如果ta收了这5块还不够舒服，还是要跟你翻脸拆伙，ta的综合损失是多少？", "char_start": 730, "char_end": 778}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "是回到单干模式，重新去拿ta的20块。", "char_start": 779, "char_end": 798}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "从拿25+，一跤跌回拿20。", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "发现没有？自然法在通过“1 + 1 > 2”给你发“社恐补贴”。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "它一出手就替你先掏了一大笔“超额收益”，一半给了对方，作为忍受你社交缺陷的基本奖励；还把另一半给到了你的账户，让你有钱去在这个基础上进一步为一些超离谱的社交事故买单。", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 930}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你把自然法给你的这双重津贴都花光了，还解决不了你的社交无能带来的对方的情绪损失，这才真的要开始掏你自己的劳动所得。", "char_start": 931, "char_end": 988}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "到这一步，你才真的进入了“还不如单干”的领域。", "char_start": 989, "char_end": 1012}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "只要你没有社交无能到掏尽了你那份超额津贴都解决不了，你那5块钱都可能有剩的，你都可以拿到20+，你拿到的都比你单干拿到的多。", "char_start": 1013, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "看懂了没有？", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1082}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "而如果你单干劳动能力就很强，以至于人家和你一合作，产生的超额利润不止10，而是100甚至1000呢？", "char_start": 1083, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你见过厨房大师傅骂人吗？这个没见过，也听过大明星在后台发脾气吧？", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1166}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "ta们所产生的那个“大于2”的超额利润就远大于10，所以对ta们的社交能力的要求就天然有大量的自然法津贴去补平，以至于照样可以维持所有人都有净收益的可持续状态。", "char_start": 1167, "char_end": 1247}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "唯一问题是——如果ta们修养更好点，ta们自己本来可以赚到更多。", "char_start": 1248, "char_end": 1280}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "而劳动这个事，显然是有经验积累问题的。越做越熟练，产生的利润越高。", "char_start": 1281, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "换言之，劳动起来，哪怕自掏腰包劳动起来，一旦你有了最基本的劳动有效性，自然法就会开始给你发补贴，弥补你社交无能造成的后果。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "而且这个补贴还有一半是作为备用金发给你的，只要你在社交能力上稍微努力就可以自己节流。", "char_start": 1377, "char_end": 1419}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你以“社恐”为由不参与劳动，你劳动也得不到，社恐问题也解决不了。", "char_start": 1420, "char_end": 1452}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你宁可自掏腰包补贴也坚决去劳动，一旦劳动经验积累到自然法补贴够大，你的社交无能不解决也自然解决了，而你还会获得劳动收入。", "char_start": 1453, "char_end": 1513}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "这份现金流迟早把你自掏的那些腰包填平还有多的。", "char_start": 1514, "char_end": 1537}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "账算清楚了，怎么做，你自己掂量。", "char_start": 1538, "char_end": 1554}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 45}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：待着家里快两年，社交恐惧，不敢工作怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045"], "summary": "围绕“两个钱包”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我们不妨粗俗一点。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我们不妨粗俗一点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "db1a4d68-e4e6-5989-9e52-0f695dbae311", "source_ordinal": 710, "reading_ordinal": 3347, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "阶层的弦", "published_at": "2025-06-26T10:22:48.648000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1919562027170497516/answer/1921513276560368276"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1.2亿人民币的石油公司……也就是注册资本不到1700万美元。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "13个员工。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这甚至都不值得花时间去写什么评论。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "做事要有尺度感，不要有人拿放大镜照蚂蚁，你就拿来当大象惊叹。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那是投影屏幕大，不是蚂蚁大。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "随时随地有这根弦，你的人生烦恼少九成，收入少说翻三倍。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没这根弦的人，大部分人生都会被浪费在为丢失的芝麻哀伤愤恨、为扑上来的蚂蚁恐惧逃避上。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "真的，大部分人生，而且是恨出心脏病、怕出抑郁症、一天二十个小时双眼圆睁、扣掉药钱就买不了饭的那种浪费。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "某种意义上讲，这根弦才是阶层天花板。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 245}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价阿富汗取消与中国的石油开采合同？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“阶层的弦”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1.2亿人民币的石油公司……也就是注册资本不到1700万美元。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1.2亿人民币的石油公司……也就是注册资本不到1700万美元。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "58d9edf0-a7c5-5ccb-b07e-43f8a2bd5a7b", "source_ordinal": 709, "reading_ordinal": 3348, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "签字人", "published_at": "2025-06-27T02:46:58.412000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1897139392247735419/answer/1919772132872811839"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "某种意义上，婚姻制度是为了给你一个信任门槛不那么高的朋友。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一旦你昏迷、失联，你的社会职责就需要有一个人来接手。你的公司、亲朋好友、各种社会机构——例如公安、社保、医疗、金融——都需要一个人提供有法律效力的答案。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个人要帮你解决因为这些不可控力造成的社会化危机，以便你醒过来时你没有因为社会关系的全面断裂变成一个社会边缘人。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "否则从你的视角看来，只知道眼前一黑，再睁眼已经物是人非。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你人事不知了，要不要卖房子抢救你？你的父母走后这个决定谁来做？", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个决定医生没法替你做，你的一般朋友想做也做不了。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没人做这个决定，你很可能只有眼前一黑，没有“再睁眼”这个续集了。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "甚至，没有配偶，作为离开父母独立生活的成年人，你旅游失踪了都没人报警。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "父母意识到不对劲已经几个月后了，报警都不知道报啥内容。而且就算报了警，子女和父母失联属于正常现象，警方哪有那么多资源去帮忙查不孝子？", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "父母自己冲到你家要锁匠帮忙开门锁，锁匠都不敢动手——因为按照法定关系，父母其实没有当然的权利查看你的隐私。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要觉得这是小事，这不是小事。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "自己背后有一个由法律关系、社会伦理保障的“自己人”是一项非常重要的安全事务，没有这根安全绳，社会对一个人——甚至是一个富人——是相当困难的挑战。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个要你孤单闯天涯，遇过“叫天天不应，叫地地不灵”的绝境后才能真正的体会到。“性权利”其实并不是婚姻关系的真正主题，那只是附带的。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 595}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：结婚如果不能拥有“合法的性要求权”，那么为什么要结婚?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“签字人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“某种意义上，婚姻制度是为了给你一个信任门槛不那么高的朋友。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "某种意义上，婚姻制度是为了给你一个信任门槛不那么高的朋友。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "13eb95c6-4062-5cc6-b8bf-90a819f40de0", "source_ordinal": 708, "reading_ordinal": 3349, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "幼稚帽", "published_at": "2025-06-27T04:00:53.726000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1917622683224498565/answer/1921734717495022179"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人最幼稚的表现就是认为一种能生存几十年、几百年乃至上千年的东西“幼稚”“愚蠢”。", "char_start": 3, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这种狂妄简直无以言表，这得多缺少人生经验才能狂成这样？", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这连“温室长大”都不足以形容，这已经到了培养皿里无土栽培的水平了。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "生活得多顺利、受过的挑战得有多微弱，才能产生这么荒唐的估计？", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但凡在红尘俗世里独立面对过哪怕一点世界的风雨，都没人会说出这种狂得没谱的话来。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没有爹妈、没有遗产、没有朋友，你自己去世界上走一走吧。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "能靠自己活着，就没有幼稚可言。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "能在群狼环伺之中活下来的，更没有一个傻瓜。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你去嘲笑这样的存在幼稚、愚蠢，只会让人感觉到你这个人根本不知生存为何物。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "Not even wrong，懂伐？", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "狂妄是比无知更糟糕的评价，别捡这种帽子往头上戴。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 323}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么伊朗那么幼稚?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“幼稚帽”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“……”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "12147b8f-6db7-5e4f-a7b0-475de51cbb65", "source_ordinal": 707, "reading_ordinal": 3350, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天人合一", "published_at": "2025-06-27T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/5d10118e4cfa11f08fd652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "heading", "index": 1, "text": "受天恩", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "明确的知道自己的一切如何来自客观世界。世界是如何从大爆炸的喷发中诞生。物质如何聚合到聚变点亮恒星。恒星如何走到终点抛洒重元素。重元素如何聚合形成星球并点燃裂变反应，如何生成大气和水，如何孕育遗传效应产生生命。生命如何在这熔炉中演化生成动物，动物如何演化出社会，社会如何演化出技术。", "char_start": 4, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "彼时彼刻，如何一路历经难以想象的造化，得出一个我，身处此时此刻。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "对这整个过程了解越深，越明白你自身——无论你把自己看得多“卑微”——是一个何等的奇迹。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你是这整个宇宙中最精妙、最核心的针尖上的天使。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "也许你在七十亿天使里排名第六十九亿九千八百万，但你的位阶已经高过了宇宙中绝大多数可动的存在——小数点后起码一万多个9的那种绝大多数。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "觉得“不幸”，其实是很奢侈的。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "heading", "index": 8, "text": "顺天道", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是指你的所作所为不违背自然法则——例如你没在尝试开发永动机。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你没在追求暴力统治人类。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你没在追求各种在数学上明确的没有可持续性可能的理想或目标。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要做到这一点，你要学习大量的自然科学、社会科学知识，从而看见恢恢天网那无数根蛛丝。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这些纵横交错的蛛丝之间，就是你可安放的自由。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "heading", "index": 14, "text": "承天命", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这些蛛丝分割界定的这个自由空间之中，其实是有风的。理论上你可以在这个空间中随意栖居浮游。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但这仍然有乘风和逆风的差别。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果你是乘风而进，历史的潮流会为你节省大量的能量、弥补你大量的失误。乃至于你即使不小心被几根蛛丝挂住，借助这股罡风的力量加上你自己的挣扎，你都有机会从蛛网上逃脱。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 620}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而要看清这风的走向，看见这潮的起伏，你恰恰需要最前面那个由最初如何到现在的理解。", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "从现在到将来的这一段，至少在短期之间是顺着从过去到现在的箭头向前延伸的。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 698}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而且你向过去回望越深，自然能向未来眺望越远。", "char_start": 699, "char_end": 721}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这三者都做到了，你就处在一个无违天道、天命所归的状态，世间的万事万物都会一齐为你效力，你的运气会好到足以支撑一切的乐观。", "char_start": 723, "char_end": 783}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你预料的必然实现，你期待的必然到来，你坐在船上顺流直下，轻拨舵轮，你要的一切都会从你的船舷漂过，俯拾可得。", "char_start": 784, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你的努力全在修船操舵，而不在划桨拉纤，因而是轻省、快乐、富余的。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 870}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "航行越久，越充满信心，直到你毫不怀疑。", "char_start": 871, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这就是天人合一。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 899}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这就是正确答案，不用再别寻了。", "char_start": 900, "char_end": 915}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"heading": 3, "paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：“天人合一”到底是什么意思？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“天人合一”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“受天恩”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "heading", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "受天恩", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "54ba48cd-9fa2-574b-b2fa-f398c9d55812", "source_ordinal": 706, "reading_ordinal": 3351, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "咁都得", "published_at": "2025-06-28T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/80bb6ce24e0711f08fd152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "多看展览。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "去任何地方出差、旅游、访问，基本上都顺带看掉档期合适的展览。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "从焊接设备到农业机械，从先锋艺术到建筑文献，从珠宝时装到香水腕表。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "例如看看埃及、巴比伦、南太平洋岛国之类的文化展，越异文化越好，你可以看到很多“人类社会的其它方案”，里面多的是“这样都行”的意外。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "例如多看看古生物展，大量令人匪夷所思的动物构型和丧心病狂的行为方式，大大扩展你的“这样都行”收藏夹。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "艺术展、影展……到处都充斥着“这样都行”。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "看得越多，对“这样都行”认识就越深。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你觉得“这怎么可能”，我告诉你“这样未必不可能”的时候，大概率都会是我赢。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为我的依据绝不仅仅是对可行性的理论计算，而是我见过某件东西——某件摆在我面前、我亲手摸过、跟卖家聊过天的东西。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这样很容易触类旁通，看见很多尚未被填补的空白，看见已经在平行领域被人行走、但本身尚未被尝试过的道路。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这道理很简单——要看见这条道路，这人必须同时了解养猪、纺织、旅游和焊接。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在这每一个领域都有无数专家比这个人专业，但同时了解过这几个领域而且有实践接触、有实地调查的疯子只有这一个。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 465}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "古往今来，天地四方，只有这么一个痴线的怪人同时对这四个风马牛不相及的东西着过迷，所以ta看到了一条能把这四颗珠子串起来的线。", "char_start": 466, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这条线对这个人简直是明摆着的，用不着什么特别的智商，几乎唯一的要求就是你也同时见过这四件东西，并且遇上这个需求。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但就是这么巧，ta就全看了。除了ta，再没有第二个。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这是“获得创意”最廉价的道路，基本不需要什么“思维训练”。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "唯一的一条，就是你得无所用心的、即使没有任何特定目的也乐此不疲的看很多年。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "大人小孩通用。只不过小孩子需要注意逐步展开，从科技馆、劳动实践这些更基础的东西开始——毕竟需要能看懂才能维持兴趣，知识到哪一步，才会对哪一步的展览产生真正的兴趣。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "另外，不要说“我不是这个专业，所以对此估计看不出什么门道，所以就不去了”。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 801}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要当这种“非礼勿视”的“专业人士”。", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "别的不说，谈恋爱都没话说，闷死个人。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 840}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：培养小孩创造力和想象力的方式有哪些？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“咁都得”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“多看展览。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "多看展览。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "943bf03f-33b0-5084-97e1-92812b2e5f9f", "source_ordinal": 705, "reading_ordinal": 3352, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "促之狭", "published_at": "2025-06-28T19:38:37.162000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1921832343947158106/answer/1922342115481977468"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这么说吧——你要怎么证明它是假的？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "技术上来说，你要证明这是假的，就得要直接去查小米的收款账户和后台数据。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "除此之外的数据全都是间接的、非直接相关的。哪怕是交付数、上险数都不能直接验证这个数据。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而要拿到权威数据，除非现在有执法机构立刻进入小米，接管服务器和财务数据来核实。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "问题是，你的这些怀疑是肯定不够触发这个级别的强制调查的。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以，目前而言，作为一般消费者，你其实没有任何有效的手段证实或者证伪这个数据。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "于是就回到了这样一个素问长期谈论的问题——既无法证实、也无法证伪的东西，意味着你可以自由选择你的立场。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个选择不看所谓真实不真实，而是看这个立场于你自己有利还是不利。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "例如——你对人宣告你相信这个数据，人对你是一个看法；你对人宣告你不相信这个数据，人对你是另一个看法。这两个不同的看法就可能对你产生不同的利弊结果。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你信不信，看你想要哪个结果，而不是它真不真实。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不过有一点可以料想——以后这类“大定游戏”可能会愈演愈烈。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "个人而言，我建议我的读者避免购买或者参与抢购这类“热烈大定”的“热门产品”。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这对你的个人品牌其实是伤害很大的。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "心中有定数的人，自然就不会热衷于参与任何“促销”活动。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "个人而言，我的原则是在我该买的时候买我想好的东西，不会因“促销”提前或者推后哪怕一天。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "碰上了，我不会拒绝；没碰上，我不视为损失。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这样的好处是我从不花时间关注任何促销活动、优惠信息，也从不去抢什么“Labubu”“乔丹鞋”这类东西——春节机票除外。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这些东西对人是巨大的消耗，而且经常导致不理智的决策。热衷这种“社交属性”的人，其实是广播一种“我是连愉快的聊天都要借助道具的人”的信息。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你可能觉得这是“融入”，但这其实是有点丢脸的。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "其实从深处来讲，我会认定隔三差五做活动、搞降价的企业第一不诚实，第二不自信，第三太傲慢。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "何谓不诚实？", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 775}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "因为你其实价格就是不高，你要做成一个“原本价格很高，但一直有折扣”的样子，这就是一种欺骗。", "char_start": 776, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你觉得你的主流客户群很吃这一套，那么请相信，我一定不属于你的“主流客户群”。你为会吃这一套的目标客户群做的一切谋算，都必定不合我意。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "何谓不自信？", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "意思是你如果真的直接按真价格标，你怕顾客觉得你太廉价、档次低。所以你要标个高价。而你又心虚，觉得客户一定接受不了你的品质值那么多钱。", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 963}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你不敢相信你的目标客户能在实际使用中认可你的定价。", "char_start": 964, "char_end": 989}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我不喜欢没有这种自信的企业的产品，而我都懒得关心你不自信的原因。", "char_start": 990, "char_end": 1022}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "何谓太傲慢？", "char_start": 1024, "char_end": 1030}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "意思是你自信你这一套很高明，能很好的拿捏你的用户。", "char_start": 1031, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "因为你认准了你的客户就是这种只要把上午的四颗板栗跟晚上的三颗板栗换一下就会突然觉得很满足的猴子。", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这背后的用心立意，在我看来，都是对自己的顾客隐性而深刻的侮辱。", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1137}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "我所接受的“多重价格体系”，必须存在真实的成本和效率上的理由，例如批发价低于零售价，例如短质保期低于长质保期，例如期货客户低于现货客户。", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1207}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "并且不允许有一丝一毫的心理操纵的企图。", "char_start": 1208, "char_end": 1227}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "一旦一家企业在销售策略中有一丝一毫的对人性弱点的利用，这个企业旗下的一切品牌和服务我都会做最大回避处理。什么人性弱点？——贪婪、虚荣、暴力、偶像崇拜。", "char_start": 1228, "char_end": 1303}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "“利用人性下坠的力赚钱”，即是以恶为业。", "char_start": 1304, "char_end": 1324}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "无法避让，我只能接受遗憾，这是尊重历史的安排。", "char_start": 1325, "char_end": 1348}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "但能回避而不回避，不但积极的给你钱赚，还热衷从你的商品中获益，我也是在助恶了。", "char_start": 1349, "char_end": 1388}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "我个人对这个做法指引下的消费体验是很满意的。因为满足这个要求的企业，把更多的精力专注在了自己的产品和服务上，价格非常单纯和稳定。", "char_start": 1389, "char_end": 1453}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "买那些“销”不靠任何手段来“促”的东西，放心，你吃不了亏。", "char_start": 1454, "char_end": 1483}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "而且你会发现，这样做，你会悄无声息的获得更多人更高的尊重。", "char_start": 1484, "char_end": 1513}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "因为你会自然而然的对“labubu”这类东西、对xx促销活动这类话题茫然无知，接不上话。", "char_start": 1514, "char_end": 1558}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "这对人散发出的是积极信号。", "char_start": 1559, "char_end": 1572}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 45}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：小米 YU7的3分钟20万辆订单是真的吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042"], "summary": "围绕“促之狭”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这么说吧——你要怎么证明它是假的？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这么说吧——你要怎么证明它是假的？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f3dd34f4-f4c8-5dd1-9a14-3dc0714f6137", "source_ordinal": 704, "reading_ordinal": 3353, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不食毒", "published_at": "2025-06-29T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/4076c62a4ed611f097625254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "事情的起因是，我男朋友的学妹发了一条朋友圈，说她妈妈的男朋友只比自己大五岁，说可以给大家推她妈妈vx，可以卖保健品给她妈妈。他学妹还有个姐姐（不知道年龄），妈妈是离异的。除我和我男朋友外的人，以下我分别称为学妹，妈妈，姐姐，妈妈男朋友。我男朋友分享这件事给我，简单来讲：他的观点：妈妈找了个比自己女儿大5岁的人谈恋爱，这很逆天。我的观点：妈妈先是她自己，然后才是妈妈，她的选择不犯法也不违反道德，谈恋爱而已，算是正常行为。我们的讨论原本到这就结束了，他就去打游戏了，晚上他打完游戏之后就不理我，也没怎么和我说话，我追问他为什么不理我，他就提到这件事（原本我都快忘了这事了，在我看来只是很平常的讨论，也", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1048, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个实在是遗憾。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "现在社会有一种非常邪恶的风气，就是拿这种反社会行为开玩笑、取乐，做出一副这种事很好玩、没必要很严肃、要有“幽默感”的样子。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1119}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "怎么说呢，如果别人反正没有和你密切交往、建立什么亲密关系的打算，那顺着你捧捧场无所谓。", "char_start": 1120, "char_end": 1163}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但只要有这个打算，例如想要提拔你、想要托付你，这类嬉笑就会产生致命的后果。", "char_start": 1164, "char_end": 1201}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如此人伦之大防，被你拿来玩笑取乐，没人会想冒险去赌你到底是不是认真的，因为人家赌注太大了，冒不起这个险。", "char_start": 1202, "char_end": 1254}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其实人人都知道——这位女题主既然起了这个疑忌，这份关系已经结束了。", "char_start": 1255, "char_end": 1288}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "换一个方向你很容易理解——如果是女方天天开玩笑要“打穿黄道十二宫”，跟你大谈“这女生ntr玩得真带感”，这玩笑你开得起吗？这恋爱你谈得起吗？这婚你结得下去吗？", "char_start": 1289, "char_end": 1368}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "法官开起“是我就判ta全家死刑”的玩笑，你还让ta审你的案子吗？", "char_start": 1369, "char_end": 1401}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "医生开起“我就喜欢多割一点做纪念”的玩笑，你还让ta做手术吗？", "char_start": 1402, "char_end": 1433}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "飞行员开起“其实撞山再拉起最带感”的玩笑，你还坐ta飞机吗？", "char_start": 1434, "char_end": 1464}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "怎么？这时候你笑不出来了？你的“幽默感”呢？", "char_start": 1465, "char_end": 1487}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你咋这么玩不起？", "char_start": 1488, "char_end": 1496}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你可能会辩解说“那些从不开这种玩笑的人一样有可能作恶”。", "char_start": 1497, "char_end": 1525}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不错，你说得很对，的确嘴上不这么说的人也可能做这类事，这甚至是有很多事实可以佐证的。", "char_start": 1526, "char_end": 1568}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "问题是，这改变不了人们“无法托付给开这种玩笑的人”的行为方式。", "char_start": 1569, "char_end": 1600}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你可以继续平时跟“兄弟/闺蜜”们拿反社会梗开玩笑，来对抗“社会规训”带给你的“窒息感”。", "char_start": 1602, "char_end": 1646}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但你要记住——这是有毒的快乐，你乐多了以为这是安全牌，拿来在错误的时间、错误的场合嘴一滑，神仙也难救。", "char_start": 1647, "char_end": 1698}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "比如这个剧情里的男主人公，怎么救？", "char_start": 1699, "char_end": 1716}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "周围看客一哄而上劝女主人公“他就是说说，你别当真”？", "char_start": 1717, "char_end": 1743}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这么劝的人，有什么真凭实据保证ta只是说说？你们觉得“不至于”是吗？那要是万一将来的确因为ta没心没肺离婚了，你们每人赔多少？写字据吧。你写下字据、下真金白银担保，也许还有点意义，否则你嘴一张就“ta没这个意思”，无凭无据，你这个担保有何意义？", "char_start": 1744, "char_end": 1866}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这些话往桌上一放，“他不是这个意思”帮当即闭嘴退散。", "char_start": 1867, "char_end": 1893}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "谁再来救这位男主？", "char_start": 1894, "char_end": 1903}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "接受教训，别拿这些话题取乐。", "char_start": 1904, "char_end": 1918}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你缺快乐缺到连这种毒垃圾也要塞进嘴里嚼一嚼，难道不该反省自己的食谱，而该为“吃垃圾的自由”而奋战吗？", "char_start": 1919, "char_end": 1969}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0482"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：现在很害怕我男朋友，不知道怎么办才好?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“不食毒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“事情的起因是，我男朋友的学妹发了一条朋友圈，说她妈妈的男朋友只比自己大五岁，说可以给大家推她妈妈vx，可以卖保健品给她妈妈。他学妹还有个姐姐（不知道年龄），妈妈是离异的。除我和我男朋友外的人，以下我分别称为学妹，妈妈，姐姐，妈妈男朋友。我男朋友分享这件事给我，简单来讲：他的观点：妈妈找了个比自己女儿大5岁的人谈恋爱，这很逆天。我的观点：妈妈先是她自己，然后才”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "事情的起因是，我男朋友的学妹发了一条朋友圈，说她妈妈的男朋友只比自己大五岁，说可以给大家推她妈妈vx，可以卖保健品给她妈妈。他学妹还有个姐姐（不知道年龄），妈妈是离异的。除我和我男朋友外的人，以下我分别称为学妹，妈妈，姐姐，妈妈男朋友。我男朋友分享这件事给我，简单来讲：他的观点：妈妈找了个比自己女儿大5岁的人谈恋爱，这很逆天。我的观点：妈妈先是她自己，然后才", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1048, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
